              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asu nĩmo ala matalilwe ma ana ma Isilaeli kũatĩĩa nyũmba sya aaĩthe moo; onthe ala matalilwe ma myako ya maeema kwĩanana na nguthu syoo maĩ ngili maana thanthatũ na itatũ na maana atano na mĩongo ĩtano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.32",
