              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now’o ana ma Isilaeli meekie; kwĩanana na onthe ala Yeova wamwĩaĩe Mose, now’o mambaa maeema moo vakuvĩ na ivevelo syoo, na now’o maendaa, kĩla mũndũ kũatĩĩa mĩvĩa yoo, kwĩanana na nyũmba sya aaĩthe moo.",
          "type": "text",
